WEBVTT

00:01:00.014 --> 00:01:03.726
Unfortunately, these drivers
are excluded from the formal economy.

00:01:04.519 --> 00:01:08.689
Unable to afford to buy
clean, efficient vehicles,

00:01:08.731 --> 00:01:13.277
they are left to rent old gas engines
from exploitative loan sharks.

00:01:14.695 --> 00:01:19.992
Because of this tough situation
that these drivers endure,

00:01:20.034 --> 00:01:22.578
they are often left
to fend for themselves.

00:01:23.913 --> 00:01:25.915
Part of what they also endure and suffer

00:01:25.915 --> 00:01:30.169
is high cost of operations
from these exploitative loan sharks.